## 8. Example: Complete Custom Theme

### 8.1 Basic Color Customization

**File:** `logseq/custom.css`

```css
/* =============================================================================
   Minimal Custom Theme
   ============================================================================= */

:root {
  /* Primary colors */
  --lx-accent-09: #6366f1; /* Indigo accent */
  --ls-primary-background-color: #fafafa;
  --ls-primary-text-color: #1f2937;

  /* Borders */
  --ls-border-color: #e5e7eb;

  /* Fonts */
  --ls-font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --ls-page-title-size: 32px;
}

/* Dark mode */
.dark-theme,
html[data-theme='dark'] {
  --ls-primary-background-color: #1f2937;
  --ls-primary-text-color: #f9fafb;
  --ls-border-color: #374151;
}

/* Customize block content */
.block-content {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* Rounded corners */
.block-ref {
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 2px 6px;
}
```

### 8.2 Advanced Theme with Assets

**File:** `logseq/custom.css`

```css
/* Custom font from assets */
@font-face {
  font-family: 'MyCustomFont';
  src: url('../assets/fonts/custom-font.woff2') format('woff2');
}

:root {
  --ls-font-family: 'MyCustomFont', sans-serif;
}

/* Background pattern */
#main-content-container {
  background-image: url('../assets/patterns/subtle-grid.png');
  background-size: 40px 40px;
  background-repeat: repeat;
}

/* Custom logo in sidebar */
.left-sidebar-inner::before {
  content: '';
  display: block;
  width: 120px;
  height: 40px;
  background-image: url('../assets/logo.svg');
  background-size: contain;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  margin: 16px 0;
}
```

