## 9. Best Practices

### 9.1 Organization

```css
/* =============================================================================
   1. CSS VARIABLES
   ============================================================================= */
:root {
  /* ... */
}

/* =============================================================================
   2. TYPOGRAPHY
   ============================================================================= */
.block-content {
  /* ... */
}

/* =============================================================================
   3. LAYOUT
   ============================================================================= */
#main-content-container {
  /* ... */
}

/* =============================================================================
   4. COMPONENTS
   ============================================================================= */
.block-ref {
  /* ... */
}
```

### 9.2 Performance

```css
/* ✅ Use CSS variables for theme values */
:root {
  --my-accent: #6366f1;
}
.my-class {
  color: var(--my-accent);
}

/* ❌ Avoid expensive selectors */
div > div > div > span {
  /* Too complex */
}

/* ✅ Use specific classes */
.block-content {
  /* Better */
}
```

### 9.3 Maintainability

```css
/* Version and metadata */
/*
 * Theme: My Custom Theme
 * Version: 1.2.0
 * Author: Your Name
 * Updated: 2025-11-23
 */

/* Comment sections clearly */
/* ========== DARK MODE ========== */
.dark-theme {
  /* ... */
}
```

### 9.4 Testing

1. ✅ Test in both light and dark modes
2. ✅ Test with different font sizes (Settings → Font size)
3. ✅ Test with long content (ensure no overflow)
4. ✅ Test on mobile (if using mobile app)

