## 12. Glossary

| Term                 | Definition                                            |
| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| **App Name**         | `"logseq"` - constant directory name for config files |
| **Custom CSS**       | User-provided CSS file for theme customization        |
| **DB-based graph**   | Graph stored in SQLite database                       |
| **File-based graph** | Graph stored as markdown files                        |
| **Hot reload**       | Automatic CSS refresh on file change                  |
| **Asset expansion**  | Converting relative paths to absolute protocols       |

